This is a beautiful morning in Kochi.
I go to the kitchen.
I open the cupboards.
The cupboards are almost empty.
There is only my coffee from home there.
I open the fridge.
The fridge is also empty.
I am hungry.
I want food.
This week I want fresh items.
I want fresh vegetables.
I walk to my desk.
I take a paper and a pen.
I write a list.
I want rice.
I want tea powder too.
Now my list is ready.
I am going to the supermarket now.
